  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malthe Winje AS feasibility study small hydro East-Africa Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malthe Winje has applied for an been approved grant support for continued project development work (feasibility studies) in East-Africa to develop av portfolio of small hydro power plants. Norad has supported phase I and II and the company has identified 7 potential HPP in Kenya and Tanzania to be developed to Financial Close and construction start in Phase III supported under this grant.</narrative>
  </description>
